    <string name="setup_section">setup checklist</string>

    <string name="setup_step1_title">GTA IV: Complete Edition 1.2.0.59</string>
    <string name="setup_step1_detail">The ASI pattern-scans this exact build. Other versions won\'t light up the HUD.</string>
    <string name="setup_step2_title">Winlator-family launcher with env vars</string>
    <string name="setup_step2_detail">GameHub Lite, Winlator / Winlator Cmod, or GameNative. Add WINEDLLOVERRIDES=dinput8=n,b in the per-game Environment variables.</string>
    <string name="setup_step3_title">ThorBridge.asi + dinput8.dll in the game folder</string>
    <string name="setup_step3_detail">Push both next to GTAIV.exe. dinput8.dll is Ultimate ASI Loader (ThirteenAG, 32-bit); download from the UAL releases page.</string>
    <string name="setup_step4_title">Launch GTA IV and load a save</string>
    <string name="setup_step4_detail">The ASI stays in safe mode until the script engine is up. On a loaded save this screen clears automatically.</string>

